---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Acquisitions"
description: "Abatec is exploring acquisition opportunities within the recruitment sector. If you're considering selling your recruitment business, get in touch."
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a> / Acquisitions</p>
    <span class="eyebrow">Acquisitions</span>
    <h1>Considering selling your recruitment business?</h1>
    <p>Abatec is on an active expansion journey and is keen to explore acquisition opportunities within the recruitment sector. If you're contemplating selling your recruitment agency, we'd welcome the conversation.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid--2" style="align-items:flex-start;">
      <div>
        <h2>What we're looking for</h2>
        <ul class="list-check">
          <li>Recruitment businesses of any size or specialism</li>
          <li>Owners considering a sale, merger, or strategic partnership</li>
          <li>A genuine opportunity to unite strengths for a more dynamic future in the talent landscape</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem;">Let's talk</h2>
        <p>Every conversation is handled personally and directly by our directors — no broker, no noise. Call Richard or Rob on <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneLink }}" style="color:var(--amber-500);font-weight:700;">{{ site.phone }}</a> to start the conversation, or send a confidential enquiry using the form.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-panel">
        <div class="form-success" id="acquisitions-success" role="status">
          <strong>Thank you.</strong> Your enquiry has been sent directly to our directors and will be treated in complete confidence. We'll respond within one working day.
        </div>
        <form data-demo-form data-success-target="acquisitions-success" novalidate>
          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="field field--full">
              <label for="acq-name">Full name *</label>
              <input type="text" id="acq-name" name="name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="acq-email">Email address *</label>
              <input type="email" id="acq-email" name="email" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="acq-phone">Phone number</label>
              <input type="tel" id="acq-phone" name="phone">
            </div>
            <div class="field field--full">
              <label for="acq-company">Company name</label>
              <input type="text" id="acq-company" name="company">
            </div>
            <div class="field field--full">
              <label for="acq-message">Tell us about your business *</label>
              <textarea id="acq-message" name="message" required placeholder="Sector focus, approximate size, and what you're exploring (sale, merger, partnership)."></textarea>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="form-note">All enquiries are received directly by our directors and treated as strictly confidential.</p>
          <button class="btn btn--primary btn--block" type="submit" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Send a confidential enquiry</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
